{"ticker":"CPAY","updated":"2026-10-30T22:41:53Z","profile":{"longName":"Corpay, Inc.","shortName":"Corpay, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","country":"United States","website":"https://www.corpay.com","fullTimeEmployees":11800,"marketCap":26325559296,"trailingPE":24.373251,"forwardPE":12.692252,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.243611,"pegRatio":0.76,"targetMeanPrice":460.66666,"targetHighPrice":536.0,"targetLowPrice":390.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.215,"earningsGrowth":-0.07,"grossMargins":0.80539,"operatingMargins":0.4692,"profitMargins":0.22723,"totalRevenue":5020502016,"beta":0.894,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":427.46,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":252.84,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Corpay, Inc. operates as a payments company that helps businesses and consumers to manage and pay their expenses.\nIt operates through Corporate Payments, Vehicle Payments, Lodging Payments, and Other segments. The company offers vehicle payment solutions for fuel, tolls and parking, vehicle compliance, auto insurance and road assistance, fleet maintenance, and long-haul transportation services, as well as prepaid food and transportation vouchers and cards. It also provides corporate payment solutions, such as cross-border payments, spend management solutions, AP modernization, virtual cards, and purchasing and T&E cards. Additionally, it offers lodging payments solutions for employees who travel overnight for work purposes; traveling crews and stranded passengers from airlines and cruise lines; workforce lodging solutions for business travel programs; airline logistics, crew management, insurance, and other payments solutions. Further, the company offers gifts and payroll cards. It serves business, merchant, consumer, and payment network customers. The company was formerly known as FLEETCOR Technologies, Inc. and changed its name to Corpay, Inc. in June 2002. Corpay, Inc. was founded in 1986 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.","summary_zh":"Corpay, Inc. 是一家支付公司，幫助企業和消費者管理和支付費用。\n它透過企業支付、車輛支付、住宿支付和其他部門運作。該公司提供燃油、通行費和停車、車輛合規、汽車保險和道路援助、車隊維護和長途運輸服務的車輛支付解決方案，以及預付食品和交通券和卡片。它還提供企業支付解決方案，例如跨境支付、支出管理解決方案、AP 現代化、虛擬卡以及採購和 T&E 卡。此外，它還為因工作而過夜的員工提供住宿支付解決方案；航空公司和遊輪公司的旅行機組人員和滯留乘客；商務旅行計劃的員工住宿解決方案；航空物流、機組人員管理、保險和其他支付解決方案。此外，該公司還提供禮品和薪資卡。它為企業、商家、消費者和支付網路客戶提供服務。該公司前身為 FLEETCOR Technologies, Inc.，並於 2002 年 6 月更名為 Corpay, Inc.。 Corpay, Inc. 成立於 1986 年，總部位於喬治亞州亞特蘭大。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 基礎設施","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":321.17,"h":322.95,"l":315.8,"c":317.79,"v":288700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":316.76,"h":319.42,"l":314.01,"c":319.37,"v":419400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":320.47,"h":320.47,"l":313.35,"c":319.94,"v":265400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":322.09,"h":327.11,"l":314.87,"c":316.65,"v":259700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":316.14,"h":316.14,"l":309.07,"c":311.59,"v":668500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":310.49,"h":315.29,"l":310.34,"c":313.12,"v":506200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":311.16,"h":313.58,"l":302.39,"c":304.8,"v":396300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":304.83,"h":314.42,"l":304.54,"c":313.6,"v":354100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":313.3,"h":313.3,"l":306.18,"c":307.36,"v":350300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":308.82,"h":311.17,"l":304.4,"c":304.86,"v":313800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":304.82,"h":307.36,"l":302.39,"c":306.29,"v":360900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":306.69,"h":315.38,"l":306.69,"c":310.63,"v":461500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":313.21,"h":313.21,"l":303.85,"c":305.27,"v":467200},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":305.88,"h":306.6,"l":298.99,"c":301.93,"v":998900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":299.55,"h":302.0,"l":297.57,"c":299.92,"v":579600},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":300.0,"h":305.29,"l":297.13,"c":298.0,"v":420900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":298.26,"h":300.14,"l":294.4,"c":296.23,"v":436600},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":294.38,"h":296.24,"l":289.04,"c":292.18,"v":357400},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":292.53,"h":298.58,"l":292.53,"c":296.7,"v":437100},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":299.79,"h":299.79,"l":292.88,"c":295.